keywords Ravenholdt, Ravenholdt Manor, The Manor Ravenholdt, Elegant Letter, Seal of Ravenholdt, Rite of Cunning, Detect Traps, Fahrad, Myrokos Silentform, Syndicate Sabotage, Lord Tomas, Durnholde Keep, What's the Big Idea?, Barton, Barton's Scouting Report, Strahnbrad, Covert Extraction, Blade of House Perenolde, Royal Aegis of Perenolde, Ruins of Alterac, A Way In, Northfold Manor, Syndicate Footlocker, Master of Disguise, Syndicate Uniform, Stromgarde, Anastasia Miller, Ain't No Telling, Stolen Funds, The Syndicate Sting, Intercepted Shipment, Thoradin's Wall, Syndicate Emblems, Rogue, reputation
